@title 600-page project: frame times while panning and zooming
@area Scale
@slow
# Needs the generated project (not committed):
#   scripts/scale-bench.sh --size large --only generate --save-project target/scale600.novo
# Run with the release build for numbers worth reading:
#   KOPERCAD_BIN_DIR=target/release scripts/qa.sh --slow --only scale-frames
# The frame_stats lines in the step list are the result. On a box without a GPU
# (software Vulkan) the whole-frame figure is the CPU rasteriser, not a graphics
# card: read the "UI pass" figure as the program's own cost.
open target/scale600.novo
wait 60
shot opened
check_blank opened
# The design check of this size runs on a worker thread: the window stays
# usable and the pill says it is still checking until the answer lands.
frame_stats none 60
wait 200
shot after-check
frame_stats pan 120
shot panned
frame_stats zoom 120
shot zoomed
check_layout
